{
  "version": "3.2.2",
  "releaseNotes": {
    "zh": [
      "macOS 更新改为跳转官网下载安装，并自动退出应用及打开“隐私与安全”。",
      "搜索联想会提前预取结果，并复用内存缓存与进行中的请求，缩短等待时间。",
      "搜索开始即隐藏 GitHub 按钮，联想面板与搜索框使用更自然的非线性动画。",
      "修复阅读器无法通过桌面侧栏退出、安卓切换词汇书时误弹键盘的问题。",
      "搜索历史支持多种排序、多选删除和批量加入词汇书。",
      "官网演示会按设备显示移动端或桌面端外观，并可切换多个功能页面。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "macOS updates now open the official download, quit Lexora, and reveal Privacy & Security.",
      "Suggestions now prefetch results and reuse memory caches plus in-flight requests for faster searches.",
      "GitHub hides as soon as searching starts, with smoother nonlinear suggestion motion.",
      "Fixed desktop sidebar reader exit and unwanted Android keyboard popups.",
      "Search history now supports sorting, multi-select deletion, and batch book creation.",
      "The website demo now adapts to mobile or desktop and includes multiple interactive pages."
    ]
  },
